<title>UK: BZW sets warrants on Edison.</title>
<headline>BZW sets warrants on Edison.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd has issued 20 million American-style warrants on Edison shares, lead manager BZW Warrants Ltd said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    10000 ITL		 ISSUE PRICE  1223 ITL</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	27.MAY.98		 PAYDATE	19.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  9425 ITL</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
